<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Lina Orundas — Brand, UX/UI &amp; Social Media Designer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Lina Orundas: multidisciplinary designer in Sweden. Graphic design, branding, social media, SEO, photography, editorial writing and UX/UI. Open to full-time, part-time and freelance work.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=DM+Mono:wght@500&family=Doto:wght@900&family=Inter+Tight:wght@500;700;800&family=Pinyon+Script&family=UnifrakturCook:wght@700&family=Unbounded:wght@900&family=Varela+Round&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ✏️ YOUR PHOTOS: put the files in an 'images' folder next to this file.
   --hero-img  = the portrait on the cover
   --about-img = the background of the About section (add yours here!) */
/* ✏️ COLORS: black, white and pink only */
:root{--hero-img:url(images/me.jpg);--about-img:url(images/about-bg.jpg);--pola-img:url(images/polaroid.jpg);--ink:#0A0A0A;--pink:#F4A7E1;--hot:#E8329E;--cream:#FBF3F8;--sans:'Inter Tight',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;--head:'Archivo Black','Inter Tight',Arial,sans-serif;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:500 19px/1.6 var(--sans);overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
ul{list-style:none}
.w{padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,56px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,56px)}
/* MENU BAR: a slim full-width bar of blurred black glass, links in the same [ bracket ] style as the rest of the site */
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));padding-bottom:14px;color:#fff;background:rgba(0,0,0,.84);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,167,225,.3);font:800 16px var(--sans)}
nav div{display:flex;gap:clamp(14px,2.4vw,34px)}
nav div a{font:500 clamp(11px,1vw,14px) 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
nav div a::before{content:"[ "}
nav div a::after{content:" ]"}
nav a:hover{color:var(--pink)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#000;font:800 18px var(--sans);padding:15px 30px;border-radius:99px;border:2px solid #fff;cursor:pointer}
.btn.o{background:none;color:#fff}
.btn:hover{background:var(--hot);border-color:var(--hot);color:#fff}
.btn.k{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff}
/* HERO: everything sits on a 12-column grid so it all lines up */
.hero{background:#000;color:#fff;min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;gap:clamp(20px,3vw,44px);padding-top:calc(78px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + clamp(12px,2vh,24px));padding-bottom:clamp(24px,3.4vw,48px)}
.mono{font:500 clamp(11px,1vw,14px)/1.3 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.tags{margin-bottom:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;color:var(--pink)}
#name{display:flex;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;font-weight:400;line-height:1;font-size:100px;width:100%}
.under{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);column-gap:clamp(16px,2vw,32px);align-items:end}
.under .txt{grid-column:1/9}
.under p{font:800 clamp(30px,5vw,78px)/1.04 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:13em}
.under p b{color:var(--pink)}
.btns{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:clamp(22px,3vw,40px);flex-wrap:wrap}
.under .pic{grid-column:10/13}
.photo{aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;border-radius:12px;background:var(--hero-img) center/cover,linear-gradient(160deg,#F4A7E1,#5a2a48)}
.under .sub{font:500 clamp(16px,1.35vw,20px)/1.55 var(--sans);color:#d6d6d6;max-width:34em;margin-top:clamp(16px,2vw,26px)}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
.cap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px;color:#bbb}
/* ABOUT: a closed pink letter. Click it and the papers spread out like a pile. Click again, or scroll away, and it folds back. ✏️ background photo = --about-img at the top of this file */
.about{padding-top:clamp(70px,8vw,120px);padding-bottom:clamp(60px,7vw,100px);color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.66),rgba(0,0,0,.66)),var(--about-img) center/cover,linear-gradient(160deg,#2a1020,#000)}
.pilewrap{container-type:inline-size;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.pile{position:relative;--e:cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.25,1)}
.paper{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;margin-top:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:left;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.4);transition:max-height .7s var(--e),opacity .5s,margin .5s,padding .5s}
.pile.open .paper{max-height:2400px;opacity:1;margin-top:16px}
.pile .p-env,.pile.open .p-env{max-height:none;opacity:1;margin-top:0}
.p-env{border:0;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;background:#F7C4EA;color:#0A0A0A;overflow:hidden;transform:rotate(-1.5deg)}
.p-env::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:52%;background:#F2B6E2;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,50% 100%)}
.p-env::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:48%;background:linear-gradient(to top right,transparent calc(50% - 1px),rgba(0,0,0,.09) 50%,transparent calc(50% + 1px)) left/50% 100% no-repeat,linear-gradient(to top left,transparent calc(50% - 1px),rgba(0,0,0,.09) 50%,transparent calc(50% + 1px)) right/50% 100% no-repeat}
.env-in{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:5cqw;z-index:1;text-align:center}
.env-t{display:block;font:400 13cqw/.9 'Pinyon Script',cursive;letter-spacing:0}
.env-h{display:block;margin-top:2cqw;font-size:3.2cqw}
.ho{display:none}.pile.open .ho{display:inline}.pile.open .hc{display:none}
.p-note{background:#fff;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 8cqw,rgba(232,50,158,.35) 8cqw,rgba(232,50,158,.35) calc(8cqw + 1px),transparent calc(8cqw + 1px)),repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0,transparent 23px,rgba(150,130,180,.22) 24px)}
.pile.open .p-note{padding:22px 18px 20px 18px;transform:rotate(.6deg)}
.p-note h3{font:400 5em/1 'Pinyon Script',cursive;margin:0 0 .15em}
.p-note .lead{font:800 1.35em/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:none}
.p-note .rest{margin-top:.9em;font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.55}
.p-note .rest p+p{margin-top:.6em}
.p-note .links{margin-top:1.2em;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5em 1.4em;font-size:.95em}
.p-note .links a:hover{color:var(--hot)}
.p-pink{background:#F7C4EA}
.pile.open .p-pink{padding:22px 18px 20px;transform:rotate(-1.5deg)}
.p-pink .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:2.2cqw;font-size:.95em}
.p-pink h4{font:400 2.3em/1 'Pinyon Script',cursive;margin:.2em 0 .25em;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:#0A0A0A}
.p-pink h4:first-child{margin-top:0}
.p-pink li{padding:1px 0;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35}
.p-pink li i{font-style:normal;font-weight:500;opacity:.7}
.bclip{display:none}
.p-pola{background:#fff;width:62%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.pile.open .p-pola{padding:8px 8px 34px;transform:rotate(3deg)}
.pphoto{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:var(--pola-img) center/cover,var(--hero-img) center/cover,linear-gradient(160deg,#F4A7E1,#5a2a48)}
.pphoto::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:#F4A7E1;mix-blend-mode:multiply}
.pcap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:10px;text-align:center;color:#444}
.pclip{display:none}
.p-scrap{display:none}
@media(min-width:1001px){
.pile{height:50cqw;transition:height .85s var(--e)}
.pile.open{height:118cqw}
.pile.snap,.pile.snap .paper{transition:none!important}
.paper{position:absolute;max-height:none;opacity:1;overflow:visible;margin:0!important;font-size:max(11px,1.25cqw);transition:left .85s var(--e),top .85s var(--e),transform .85s var(--e)}
.p-env{overflow:hidden;left:21cqw;top:6cqw;width:58cqw;height:36cqw;aspect-ratio:auto;z-index:10;transform:rotate(-2deg)}
.pile.open .p-env{left:6cqw;top:2cqw;z-index:3;transform:rotate(-3deg)}
.env-t{font-size:9cqw}.env-h{font-size:1.2cqw;margin-top:1cqw}.env-in{bottom:4cqw}
.p-note{left:21cqw;top:-4.5cqw;width:62cqw;z-index:2;padding:3.2cqw 3cqw 3cqw 10cqw;transform:rotate(3deg) scale(.75);transition-delay:.05s}
.pile.open .p-note{left:36cqw;top:46cqw;transform:rotate(.8deg) scale(1);padding:3.2cqw 3cqw 3cqw 10cqw}
.p-pink{left:25cqw;top:-1cqw;width:42cqw;z-index:4;padding:3cqw;transform:rotate(-6deg) scale(.75);transition-delay:.09s}
.pile.open .p-pink{left:2cqw;top:54cqw;transform:rotate(-2deg) scale(1);padding:3cqw}
.bclip{display:block;position:absolute;left:3cqw;top:-3.6cqw;width:6.5cqw;z-index:2}
.p-pola{left:67.5cqw;top:4cqw;width:25cqw;margin:0;z-index:5;padding:1cqw 1cqw 4.5cqw;transform:rotate(9deg) scale(.7);transition-delay:.13s}
.pile.open .p-pola{left:58cqw;top:6cqw;z-index:8;transform:rotate(4deg) scale(1);padding:1cqw 1cqw 4.5cqw}
.pclip{display:block;position:absolute;right:2.5cqw;top:-3.4cqw;width:3cqw;z-index:3}
.pcap{bottom:1.4cqw;font-size:1cqw}
.p-scrap{display:block;left:15cqw;top:8cqw;width:30cqw;height:36cqw;z-index:1;background:#fff repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0,transparent 1.5cqw,rgba(150,130,180,.25) 1.55cqw);transform:rotate(-8deg) scale(.7);transition-delay:.02s}
.pile.open .p-scrap{left:0;top:40cqw;transform:rotate(-6deg) scale(1)}
.pile.open{cursor:pointer}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.pile,.paper{transition:none!important}}
/* CONTENTS */
section{padding-top:clamp(70px,9vw,130px)}
h2.t{font:400 clamp(48px,9vw,130px)/1 var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:clamp(24px,4vw,50px)}
h2.t i{font-style:normal;color:var(--hot)}
.toc a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;padding:18px 0;border-top:3px solid var(--ink);font:400 clamp(24px,4.2vw,56px)/1.1 var(--head);text-transform:uppercase}
.toc a:last-child{border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink)}
.toc a span{color:var(--hot);font-size:.6em}
.toc a:hover{color:var(--hot);padding-left:14px}
.toc a{transition:padding .2s}
/* WORK RAILS */
.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.8fr) 1.6fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);padding-top:clamp(40px,5vw,70px);padding-bottom:clamp(40px,5vw,70px);border-top:3px solid var(--ink);scroll-margin-top:70px}
.side{align-self:start;position:sticky;top:90px}
.num{font:400 22px var(--head);color:var(--hot)}
.side h3{font:400 clamp(34px,4.2vw,60px)/1 var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:8px 0 12px}
.side .tag{font:800 24px/1.25 var(--sans);margin-bottom:12px}
.side h4{font:400 18px var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;margin:22px 0 6px;color:var(--hot)}
.side li{padding:3px 0}
.tools{margin-top:18px;font-weight:800}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(16px,2vw,28px)}
.btn.sm{font-size:16px;padding:12px 24px;margin-top:22px}
.go{display:block;margin-top:8px;font:500 13px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hot);font-style:normal}
.c{display:block}
.c:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}
.c:first-child .im{aspect-ratio:16/10}
.im{aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:16px;background-size:cover;background-position:center;transition:transform .25s}
.c:hover .im{transform:scale(.97)}
.c b{display:block;font:800 clamp(22px,2vw,28px)/1.15 var(--sans);margin-top:12px}
.c:hover b{color:var(--hot)}
.c span{display:block;color:#444;margin-top:4px}
/* editorial article */
.art{grid-column:1/-1;background:var(--cream);border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,40px)}
.art .page{columns:2;column-gap:32px;font:400 19px/1.65 Georgia,serif;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto}
.art .page p+p{margin-top:14px}
.art .page p:first-child::first-letter{font:700 5.4em/.8 'UnifrakturCook',serif;float:left;margin:.06em .1em 0 0;color:var(--hot);background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--ink);padding:.06em .1em .02em}
.art h5{font:400 24px var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}
/* CONTACT */
.ct{background:#000;color:#fff;margin-top:clamp(70px,9vw,130px);padding-top:clamp(60px,8vw,110px);padding-bottom:50px;text-align:center}
.ct h2{font:400 clamp(54px,12vw,190px)/.95 var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.ct h2 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--pink)}
.clock{font:700 20px var(--sans);margin:14px 0 6px}
.clock b{color:var(--pink)}
.ct>p{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 24px;font-size:22px}
.lbl{font:400 18px var(--head);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pink);margin:34px 0 14px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.chip{font:700 17px var(--sans);color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:99px;padding:10px 20px;background:none;cursor:pointer}
.chip:hover,.chip.on{background:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink);color:#000}
.mail{display:inline-block;margin-top:34px;font:700 clamp(20px,3.4vw,40px) var(--sans);border-bottom:3px solid var(--pink);padding-bottom:6px;background:none;border-top:0;border-left:0;border-right:0;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}
.mail:hover{color:var(--pink)}
.ct .btns{justify-content:center}
.badge{width:130px;height:130px;margin:0 auto 10px;animation:sp 16s linear infinite}
.badge text{font:800 11px var(--sans);fill:#fff;letter-spacing:.12em}
@keyframes sp{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:26px;right:26px;background:var(--hot);color:#fff;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:800;transform:translateY(100px);opacity:0;transition:.35s;z-index:20}
.toast.show{transform:none;opacity:1}
@media(max-width:860px){.seg{grid-template-columns:1fr}.under{display:block}.under .pic{margin-top:32px;max-width:300px}.tags span:nth-child(2){display:none}.side{position:static}.art .page{columns:1}nav div{gap:12px}nav{font-size:14px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.badge{animation:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="w"><a href="#top">Lina Orundas</a><div><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#contact">Let's connect</a></div></nav>

<!-- NOTE (cover portrait): the photo on the cover is images/me.jpg. Use a portrait photo of you, about 1000 x 1250 px (4:5), JPG, under 400 KB. The same photo is reused (in black and white) on the polaroid in the About folder. -->
<header class="hero w" id="top">
  <div class="tags mono"><span>[ Branding, Social Media, SEO, Editorial Writing ]</span><span>[ Graphic Design, UX-UI, Photography, Illustration ]</span><span>[ Based in Sweden ]</span></div>
  <h1 id="name" aria-label="Lina Orundas">Lina Orundas</h1>
  <div class="under">
    <div class="txt">
<p>As a visual designer, I shape distinct brand identities, interactive digital interfaces, <b>and compelling stories.</b></p>      
       <p class="sub">I'm Lina, a final-year New Media Design student in Sweden. I craft brand identities, digital interfaces, and social content, supercharging them with SEO and marketing strategy so they perform in the real world. Blending design, web, photography, and editorial work into a cohesive creative practice.</p>
      <!-- NOTE (CV button): the "Download CV" button stays hidden until you paste a link to your CV PDF into var CV="" in the script at the bottom of this file. -->
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Let's connect</a><a class="btn o" href="#work">See my work</a><a class="btn o" id="cvh" hidden>Download CV</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pic">
      <div class="photo" role="img" aria-label="Lina Orundas"></div>
      <div class="cap mono"><span>[ Lina ]</span><span>[ Creative designer ]</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- NOTES for the About letter (only visible in the code, not on the website):
     1) images/about-bg.jpg = the dark background behind the whole letter. Wide landscape photo, about 2000 x 1200 px, JPG, under 500 KB. A calm or darker photo works best because a dark layer sits on top.
     2) images/polaroid.jpg = the photo on the clipped polaroid. Portrait, about 800 x 1000 px (4:5), JPG, under 300 KB. It is tinted pink automatically. If this file is missing, images/me.jpg (your cover portrait) is used instead.
     3) images/me.jpg = your cover portrait (also the fallback for the polaroid).
     4) The text on the notebook page, the pink sheet and the links row are written right here in the HTML below. Edit them in place.
     How it works: click the pink letter and the papers spread out. Click again, or scroll past it, and it folds back into a pile. -->
<section class="about w" id="about" style="margin-top:0">
  <div class="pilewrap">
    <div class="pile" id="pile">
      <div class="paper p-scrap" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="paper p-note">
        <h3>Hi, I'm Lina</h3>
        <p class="lead">Positioned at the cross-section of brand identity, digital interfaces, and content, I create design solutions that strike a balance between high aesthetics and strategic function. Originally from Istanbul and currently based in Sweden, I bring a global, multi-city lens to my craft. My signature approach lies in blending the chaotic beauty and intricate depth of Istanbul with the sleek, quiet precision of Scandinavian minimalism, transforming rich cultural nuances into seamless digital experiences.</p>
        <div class="rest">
          <p>I don’t just design digital experiences; <strong>I give them momentum.</strong> From crafting custom identities and sleek interfaces to directing video and optimizing search visibility, I handle every layer of the creative process to launch work that gets seen and measured.</p>
          <p>A creative driven by art, music, fashion, and visual storytelling, I apply a keen eye for detail and color to layout design and typography. Experienced in cross-functional group projects, volunteer marketing, and social media management, I am comfortable working within structured briefs and meeting deadlines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="links mono"><a href="mailto:linaorundas70@gmail.com">[ Email ]</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.behance.net/linaorundas">[ Behance ]</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lina-orundas-022067332/">[ LinkedIn ]</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.instagram.com/portalpress/">[ Portal Press ]</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://instagram.com/luakovsky">[ Instagram ]</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="paper p-pink">
        <svg class="bclip" viewBox="0 0 70 84" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 34V16C16 2 54 2 54 16v18" fill="none" stroke="#c9c9c9" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 34h54l-6 46H14z" fill="#222"/></svg>
        <div class="two">
          <div>
            <h4>What I bring</h4>
            <ul><li>Brand and Digital in one person</li><li>Design plus SEO and marketing</li><li>Clear, user-first thinking</li><li>Team-ready and Multilingual</li><li>Out of Box Thinking</li><li>Translating abstract ideas into tangible reality</li><li>I design the look and write the hook</li><li>I bridge artistic intuition with business goals</li><li>Fast execution without sacrificing deep strategy</li><li>Designs that command attention and drive clicks</li></ul>
            <h4>Languages</h4>
            <ul><li>English <i>Fluent</i></li><li>Turkish <i>Fluent</i></li><li>German <i>B1</i></li><li>Swedish <i>A1</i></li><li>Norwegian <i>A1</i></li></ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Skills</h4>
            <ul><li>Graphic design and Brand Identity</li><li>UX - UI and Web Design</li><li>Social Media Content Design, Planing &amp; Creation</li><li>SEO and Digital Marketing</li><li>Photography &amp; Directing</li><li>Motion Design &amp; Graphics</li><li>Illustrations and Editorial Writing</li><li>Mixed Media (Print &amp; Digital)</li></ul>
            <h4>Software</h4>
            <ul><li>Figma</li><li>Adobe Illustrator</li><li>Adobe Photoshop</li><li>Adobe InDesign</li><li>Adobe Premiere Pro</li><li>Adobe Fresco</li><li>Adobe Lightroom</li><li>Capcut</li><li>Final Cut Pro</li><li>CapCut</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="paper p-pola">
        <svg class="pclip" viewBox="0 0 26 70" fill="none" stroke="#9aa0a6" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 30V13a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v40a9 9 0 0 1-18 0V22"/></svg>
        <div class="pphoto" role="img" aria-label="Lina Orundas"></div>
        <span class="pcap mono">[ Lina Orundas ]</span>
      </div>

      <button class="paper p-env" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pile">
        <span class="env-in"><span class="env-t">About me</span><span class="env-h mono"><span class="hc">[ Click to open ]</span><span class="ho">[ Click to close ]</span></span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="w" id="work">
